  "description": "At twenty, I thought my first summer would be a little special. I thought that once I moved to Seoul, I’d date a sweet guy from the city, but the reality was working a part-time job serving shaved ice, just me and my male friend from back home...! We’d been as close as siblings since childhood. Jang Je-Yeol, with his shameless swagger, was absolutely not someone I’d ever consider dating. But maybe it was the heat of summer getting to me? I ended up impulsively kissing Jang Je-Yeol.\n\n *“Why… does he look so handsome?”*\n\nBack and forth—the untold story of that summer.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
